---

This project links against and redistributes header/wrapper files from
Blackmagic Design's DaVinci Resolve IO Encode Plugin SDK (see include/ and
wrapper/ folders, and docs/SDK-README.txt). Those files are Blackmagic
Design's own and are included here as required to build against their SDK;
they are not covered by the MIT license above.

This project also links against FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org) at build time.
FFmpeg's libavcodec/libavutil/libswscale are licensed under LGPL/GPL
depending on build configuration — check the license of the specific
FFmpeg build you link against before redistributing compiled binaries.
